ncy and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1dipxCrjN_cQ7kNvwEu97r7&_nc_oc=AdqYxUG1MJNZCcxXl60mbgE8rVOavvUn3jnyaMLJxFMIqAhPeBnQnKQeOO3kaUz8Vkg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAVVesGiHZ9fZYPO9oVSYhsQ6FveqlGVzj4UvYOtYkDPg&oe=6A6CA3B9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VwzBjVhkQmoQ7kNvwF-Fpda&_nc_oc=AdrUCq0WTss4pyX4sR643Lp_8C19lcTF0gb7ZJdFrQvOz6N_rSS1AZvlrljPQPeDtHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAJDsIA9Afi1fpGLwddgtuAIqzliJTu9K8DZwb4ZIuaaA&oe=6A6C920F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u9D-5jL-aMMQ7kNvwE8Rahe&_nc_oc=Adod-87fbwYi-5LEN5aa0noHAHBvYOhMSCSIys9Yt05NgLHDhKFBMKMiRZPN3isy_pQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDEjJM2RDveJpaSDPnEAQhYJiw0m7f3b3zeXr9b5yEqiA&oe=6A6C9FEE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squar